  "explanation": "The question asks for the formation year of '302 Squadron'. Multiple documents provide conflicting formation years for different incarnations of the 302 Squadron:\n\n- **1974** (Document D1S1): Refers to the formation of a Japanese Air Self-Defense Force (JASDF) 302 Squadron.\n- **1940** (Documents D3S4, D4S3, D5S4): Refers to the formation of the 302 (City of Poznan) Polish Fighter Squadron during World War II.\n- **1981** (Document D6S2): Refers to the formation of the 302 Squadron in Portugal.\n- **1950** (Document D2S1): Also claims the formation of a JASDF 302 Squadron, but it conflicts with the 1974 claim and is not included due to uncertainty about whether it refers to the same squadron.\n\nEach of these claims refers to a distinct 302 Squadron in different countries and contexts. Therefore, all three confirmed distinct formation years (1974, 1940, and 1981) are valid and should be retained."
